  "releaseNotes": "API Updates:\n* Refresh the Bing Ads API Version 13 Campaign Management and Reporting service proxies and generated REST serialization support.\n* Add BrandExclusionSetting and its ProductAdsOptOut property while preserving published CampaignAdditionalField flag values.\n* Add the JobTitle campaign criterion type and Google import UpdateNCASettings support.\n* Add AssetGroupId and AdId columns to the Asset Performance report.\n* Update the SDK Api-Revision header to 2026-09-14.\n\nBulk API Updates:\n* Add BulkCompanyList and BulkCompanyItem entities with Company Name and Audience Size CSV mappings and bulk factory support.",
